{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_005yay0204_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_005yay0204_1000_p", "source_sha256": "cb61f72c4b44fbcaac852332ec747d7ab879c41f0efd3ee9d4da7f4af5748c8c", "ja": "やよい、お疲れさま。ブログ読んだよ。\n衣装は問題なさそうかな？", "zh": "弥生，辛苦了。我看过博客了。\n服装看起来没什么问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
